        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>面试开口素材积累 - 互联网银发知播</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #f2ede4;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .card {\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdf6ec;\n    border: 6px solid #e8630a;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 18px 20px 30px 20px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .main-title {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    max-width: 380px;\n  }\n  .day-badge {\n    width: 68px;\n    height: 68px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e8630a;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .day-badge .num {\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n  .subtitle-bar {\n    background: #e8630a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .para {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    color: #222;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .num-circle {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border: 2px solid #e0359a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #e0359a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-right: 2px;\n  }\n  mark.pink {\n    background: none;\n    color: inherit;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 55%, #f7b8c9 55%);\n  }\n  mark.orange {\n    background: none;\n    color: inherit;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 55%, #f9c88a 55%);\n  }\n  .underline-blue {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #2f6fdc;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;\n  }\n  .box-blue {\n    border: 1.5px solid #2f6fdc;\n    padding: 0 3px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .circle-mark {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    border: 2px solid #e0359a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    margin-right: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n\n  <div class=\"header-row\">\n    <div class=\"main-title\">面试开口素材积累</div>\n    <div class=\"day-badge\">\n      <span>DAY</span>\n      <span class=\"num\">13</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle-bar\">互联网—银发知播</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">三、对策</div>\n\n  <div class=\"para\">\n    <span class=\"num-circle\" style=\"border-color:#e0359a;\">1</span>\n    权威帮助，搭建平台。一方面，我们需重视\n    \"银发\"群体，给予更多的关注和帮助，使更多的\n    <mark class=\"orange\">\"银发族\"能够克服电子困境，</mark>\n    从而能够更好地继续发挥自己的专业技能和经验；另一方面，我们也需要注重创造更多的社会机会和平台，\n    <span class=\"underline-blue\">期待更多有知识、有文化、有智慧的老人加入\"银发知播\"队伍，</span>\n    成为传播科学知识和科技发展的\"忘年青年\"，在更多领域生动演绎\"时光不老\"的传说。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"para\">\n    <span class=\"num-circle\" style=\"border-color:#2f6fdc;\">2</span>\n    疏堵结合，算法推荐。规范短视频平台，在创新监管手段、严惩违法违规行为之外，\n    <mark class=\"orange\">还要挖掘、创作更多更好的优质内容，</mark>\n    形成\n    <span class=\"box-blue\">\"良币驱逐劣币\"的效应。</span>\n    平台要切实履行主体责任，在流量引导、算法推荐上向优质\"知播\"倾斜，营造健康理性的网络视频生态，为忘年短视频作品的传播营造良好环境，多一些类似\"银发知播\"这样有温度、有深度的优质内容推送。\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
